    `netlify/functions`, for example `auth/magic-link.ts`.
  - `@netlify/database` exposes `getDatabase().pool.query(...)`; use
    parameterized SQL for helper modules under `netlify/lib`.
  - Magic-link login currently upserts a user before inserting the token
    because `magic_link_tokens.user_id` is non-nullable.
  - Resend delivery uses `RESEND_API_KEY`, with optional
    `RESEND_FROM_EMAIL`; no Resend SDK dependency is required.
  - Session cookies require `SESSION_SECRET` outside test/local Netlify mode.
